    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef" title=3D"Background color : Light green 35%">Update</td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef" title=3D"Background color : Light green 35%"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef" title=3D"Background color : Light green 35%">PUT</td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef" title=3D"Background color : Light green 35%">
     <p>/users/{idp-sub}? <span style=3D"color:#172b4d;" title=3D""><em>sou=
rceIdpSub=3D&lt;existing idp subject&gt; &amp; activationDate=3Dxx</em></sp=
an></p>
     <p><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;" title=3D""><em>sourceIdpSub, if spec=
ified then update profile based on exsiting user setup. pre-processing logi=
c for request body:<br>
         1. lookup existing user attributes for identity and access-control=
 and create json same as defined for requestBody.<br>
         2. override with attributes in this request's body.<br>
         4. set accessProfileSet to true, <span style=3D"color:#172b4d;" ti=
tle=3D"">if featurePackage is set</span></em></span></p>
     <p><br></p>
     <ol>
      <li>push updates to Okta for attributes like language <u>only</u> whe=
n idp =3D nbin</li>
      <li>allow updates to identity/personal profile attributes&nbsp;<u>onl=
y</u> when idp =3D nbin</li>
     </ol></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef" title=3D"Background color : Light green 35%">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
       <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl hide-border-bottom">
        <b class=3D"code-title"></b><span class=3D"collapse-source expand-c=
ontrol" style=3D"display:none;"><span class=3D"expand-control-icon icon">&n=
bsp;</span><span class=3D"expand-control-text">Expand source</span></span><=
span class=3D"collapse-spinner-wrapper"></span>
       </div>
       <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl hide-toolbar">
        <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=
=3D"brush: js; gutter: false; collapse: true">{
  "secureZoneId": "SZ1234",
  "ossId": "ACOH123",
  "ossProxyId": "ACHOHG",
  "ossUserId": "ACOH123",
  "ossGroupId": "ACOH123H",
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@nbc.com",
  "preferredLanguage": "EN",
  "compassR2Id": "12345",
  "rrCode-ranges": [
    {"from": "AUT8", "to": ""}
  ],
  "featurePackage": {
  "packageTemplateId": 1,
  "assignments": [
    {
      "assignmentId": 2,
      "selected": true
    }
  ]}
}</pre>
       </div>
      </div>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef" title=3D"Background color : Light green 35%">
     <ul title=3D"">
      <li>200 OK for success</li>
     </ul></td>
