    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <h4 id=3D"UserConfigurationAPI-UF3">UF3</h4></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper"><img class=3D"con=
fluence-embedded-image confluence-external-resource" draggable=3D"false" al=
t=3D"(tick)" src=3D"13a37f088e2ac540f19378df1c3e59610a00e753e915ed001105dd5=
327eabdee" data-image-src=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/s/4w5oca/8804/1gnlhi9/_/im=
ages/icons/emoticons/check.svg"></span></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Delete assignment</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">DELETE</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">/users/{idp-sub}/assignments/{assignment-typ=
e}/{assignee-id}</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTd">access-control=
:edit_user</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#8590a2;"><s>UF4</s></s=
pan></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#8590a2;">&nbsp;</span>=
</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#8590a2;">&nbsp;</span>=
</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#8590a2;"><s>refresh RR=
 Codes, Resource and/or user group assignments available to the user via fi=
rms</s></span></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#8590a2;"><s>POST</s></=
span></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#8590a2;"><s>/users/{us=
er-id}/assignments/refresh?assignment_type=3Drr-range</s></span></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <ul>
       <li><span style=3D"color:#8590a2;"><s>default expiry to 9999-12-31</=
s></span></li>
      </ul>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#8590a2;"><s>refresh (unless assignment type i=
s specified)</s></span></p>
     <ul>
      <li><span style=3D"color:#8590a2;"><s>rr-range based on firm rr chang=
es when assigned&nbsp; user group has firm_scope =3D true</s></span></li>
      <li><span style=3D"color:#8590a2;"><s>resources update based on</s></=
span>
       <ul>
        <li><span style=3D"color:#8590a2;"><s>user package update</s></span=
></li>
        <li><span style=3D"color:#8590a2;"><s>firm's package update</s></sp=
an></li>
       </ul></li>
      <li><span style=3D"color:#8590a2;"><s>Expire existing assignments wit=
h the requests effective date</s></span></li>
     </ul></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D=
"color:#8590a2;"><s>access-control:edit_user</s></span></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <h4 id=3D"UserConfigurationAPI-UF5">UF5</h4></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper"><img class=3D"con=
fluence-embedded-image confluence-external-resource" draggable=3D"false" al=
t=3D"(tick)" src=3D"13a37f088e2ac540f19378df1c3e59610a00e753e915ed001105dd5=
327eabdee" data-image-src=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/s/4w5oca/8804/1gnlhi9/_/im=
ages/icons/emoticons/check.svg"></span></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">:warning:3</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Get associations for a user</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">GET</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">/users/{idp-sub}/assignments?<span style=3D"=
color:#172b4d;">active=3Dtrue&amp;assignment_type=3D(firm, rr-range, user-g=
roup, feature-package, resource)</span></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper"></div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
       <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
        <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=
=3D"brush: java; gutter: false">[{
  "assignment_type": "",
  "assignee_id": "",
  "name": "if applicable",=20
 &nbsp;"capability": "",&nbsp;
&nbsp; "from-rr-code": "",
  "to-rr-code": ""
}]</pre>
       </div>
      </div>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li>from-rr-code and to-rr-code applicacble only for assignment_type=
=3Drr-range</li>
      <li>Ensure user state !=3D decommissioned</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTd">access-control=
:view_user</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <h4 id=3D"UserConfigurationAPI-UF6">UF6</h4></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>:warning:</p>
      <p>role, permission and feature params</p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">:warning:4</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Get my assignments</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">GET</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">/users/me/assignments?<span style=3D"color:#=
172b4d;">active=3Dtrue&amp;assignment_type=3D(firm, rr-range, user-group, f=
eature-package, resource, <em>roles, permission and feature</em>)</span></t=
d>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper"></div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
       <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
        <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=
=3D"brush: java; gutter: false">[{
  "assignment_type": "",
  "assignee_id": "",
  "name": "if applicable",=20
 &nbsp;"capability": "",&nbsp;
&nbsp; "from-rr-code": "",
  "to-rr-code": ""
}]</pre>
       </div>
      </div>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li>from-rr-code and to-rr-code applicable only for assignment_type=
=3Drr-range</li>
      <li>support multiple assigment_type param</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTd">access-control=
:view_user_self</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <h4 id=3D"UserConfigurationAPI-UF7">UF7</h4></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">:tick:</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">refresh Resource assignments update</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">POST</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">/users/firm/{firm-id}/assignments/resource/r=
efresh</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><br></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><br></p>
      <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
       <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
        <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=
=3D"brush: java; gutter: false">UC-&gt;&gt;UC: find users for firm (U6) Ens=
ure user state !=3D decommissioned loop for each user id
FC-&gt;&gt;UC: refresh access for assignment_type resource (UF4)
UC-&gt;&gt;A: [A] get feature package template assignments for user's featu=
re package (PT7)
UC-&gt;&gt;A: get feature package template assigned to firm (AF10)
UC-&gt;&gt;A: [B] get feature package template assignments for firm's featu=
re package (PT7)
UC-&gt;&gt;UC: find resources common between [A] and [B]
UC-&gt;&gt;A: re-create resource assignment for user (UF2)</pre>
       </div>
      </div>
     </div></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTd">access-control=
:edit_user</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <h4 id=3D"UserConfigurationAPI-UF8">UF8</h4></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">:cross:</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">refresh rr assignment for firm scope users</=
td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">POST</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">/users/firm/{firm-id}/assignments/rr-range/r=
efresh</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><br></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul style=3D"list-style-type: square;">
      <li>find all users of this firm that have UG of isFirmScope =3D true<=
/li>
      <li>Ensure user state !=3D decommissioned</li>
      <li>assign new firm ranges to such users</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTd">access-control=
:edit_user</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#626f86;">UB1</span></t=
d>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#626f86;">POST</span></=
td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#626f86;">/users/{user-=
id}/assignments/branch</span></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTd">access-control=
:edit_user</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#626f86;">UB2</span></t=
d>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#626f86;">DELETE</span>=
</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#626f86;">/users/{user-=
id}/assignments/branch</span></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTd">access-control=
:edit_user</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
